WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
(upbeat music)

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:15.697
- Kids, get in here.

00:00:15.697 --> 00:00:17.649
I got Mickey Mouse on the TV.

00:00:17.649 --> 00:00:19.262
It's mommy daddy alone time.

00:00:19.262 --> 00:00:21.845
(upbeat music)

00:00:30.428 --> 00:00:31.261
- Whoa.

00:00:34.983 --> 00:00:36.470
Okay, okay, but only if I can wash my hair

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:37.303
at the same time.

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:38.136
- Yeah, yeah, of course.

00:00:38.136 --> 00:00:38.969
- Okay.

00:00:38.969 --> 00:00:39.802
- [Voiceover] Mom.

00:00:39.802 --> 00:00:41.885
- Mommy is on the toilet.

00:00:43.302 --> 00:00:44.135
Morning.

00:00:45.396 --> 00:00:46.229
- Morning.

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:58.217
(squeal)

00:00:58.217 --> 00:00:59.072
- Go go go go.

00:00:59.072 --> 00:01:00.006
The kids are occupied.

00:01:00.006 --> 00:01:02.175
We have about five minutes
until they are bored.

00:01:02.175 --> 00:01:05.092
(discordant music)

00:01:09.018 --> 00:01:09.935
- Mom, Dad.

00:01:12.021 --> 00:01:13.771
- Ah, it's your turn.

00:01:14.648 --> 00:01:15.481
- Fine.

00:01:18.315 --> 00:01:21.243
(kids laughing)

00:01:21.243 --> 00:01:24.243
("Fun of the Fair")

00:01:26.736 --> 00:01:28.237
(whoosh and squeak)

00:01:28.237 --> 00:01:29.070
(moan)

